election" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420349 1078 #edb/ref 17592186420339 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420349 1079 #uuid "916484e9-1c80-5d3a-8194-ccf0b63cf5fb" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420350 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420338 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420350 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420342 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420350 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420343 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420350 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420345 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420350 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420347 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420350 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420350 1077 "selection" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420350 1078 #edb/ref 17592186420345 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420350 1079 #uuid "ff922856-e3c4-5b40-8d0e-cd85fae942ae" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420351 1068 #edb/ref 17592186420349 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420351 1069 "q-82285" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420351 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420351 1071 "Which of the following determinants are equal to $0?$\n\n$$\n|A|=|\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 5 & \\sqrt{3} & 5 \\\\ 0 & 8 & -1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|,\\,|B|=|\\begin{aligned}6 & \\sqrt{7} & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}|,\\,|C|=|\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -\\sqrt{2} & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}|\n$$" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420351 1072 #uuid "2642af15-1045-5d0f-97c1-3ce034155f08" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420351 1074 "Let's examine each of the given determinants in turn. \n\n- The matrix $A$ has identical columns: \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 5 & \\sqrt{3} & 5 \\\\ 0 & 8 & -1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nAs a result, $|A|=0.$\n\n- The matrix $B$ has identical rows: \n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}6 & \\sqrt{7} & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nAs a result, $|B|=0.$\n\n- The matrix $C$ has a zero row: \n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -\\sqrt{2} & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nAs a result, $|C|=0.$\n\nTherefore, $|A|,$ $|B|,$ and $|C|$ are equal to $0.$" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420352 1068 #edb/ref 17592186420350 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420352 1069 "q-82192" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420352 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420352 1071 "Find $7det(A)-2det(B)$, where \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & -1 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 1 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ \\sqrt{3} & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -0.5 & 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420352 1072 #uuid "89fae1b5-1405-51b4-b87d-75b6acbbdc2e" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420352 1074 "Let's examine each matrix in turn.\n\n- Since $A$ has two identical columns, we obtain\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & -1 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 1 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\,⟹\\,det(A)=0.\n$$\n\n- Since $B$ is a triangular matrix, its determinant is given by the product of the elements of the main diagonal: \n\n$$\ndet(B)=3\\cdot (-1)\\cdot 1\\cdot 2=-6\n$$\n\nTherefore, $7det(A)-2det(B)=7\\cdot 0-2\\cdot (-6)=12.$" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420353 1068 #edb/ref 17592186420348 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420353 1069 "q-42463" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420353 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420353 1071 "$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the matrix given above. Identify **all** of the reasons why one can conclude that $|A|=0?$\n\n- $A$ has identical rows\n- $A$ has proportional columns\n- $A$ has a zero row" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420353 1072 #uuid "d2486be8-75b8-51f1-882e-08f8a79961f2" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true] [17592186420353 1074 "Let's examine each of the statements in turn.\n\n- $A$ does *not* have identical rows.\n\n- $A$ does *not* have proportional columns.\n\n- $A$ has a zero row: \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & 4\\end{aligned}]\\,✓\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" 13194139534371 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-19fc08ca-72fe-570b-a146-ccf5baf503d8" 17592186420333 "answer-246b7875-4b94-5946-ab56-53b0efdaa23b" 17592186420334 "answer-2c504700-553a-587d-937f-efdc724865fe" 17592186420335 "answer-3d56a853-a4e2-5868-a11b-a8fda7f31398" 17592186420336 "answer-462e1c30-a350-5b46-a5e5-cd8202fb5f1a" 17592186420337 "answer-52a1dbcb-127d-567f-b362-0ca0b1d54e42" 17592186420338 "answer-545d8b36-38e5-559e-a61d-ce2a27111cbd" 17592186420339 "answer-583e2bd2-06b9-53e2-a4b9-5c8a9049a9c1" 17592186420340 "answer-6272e38a-2afb-598f-b018-441d73a31140" 17592186420341 "answer-748fa6b4-08c9-57b1-9c5f-ace131b66c19" 17592186420342 "answer-76cec32a-c27c-5e6c-94e2-bb27825747c5" 17592186420343 "answer-7c57cc06-ff92-5adf-9092-769447c60c32" 17592186420344 "answer-b70ba875-07c9-5c3f-85df-154df641f91f" 17592186420345 "answer-e5b9947c-9286-555b-9fb9-6a06456c5033" 17592186420346 "answer-ec20d6e5-b2d8-5e04-b68d-e1fd68f53231" 17592186420347 "answer-field-3924ef22-234b-5f76-ad06-7ddc5f55eff3" 17592186420348 "answer-field-916484e9-1c80-5d3a-8194-ccf0b63cf5fb" 17592186420349 "answer-field-ff922856-e3c4-5b40-8d0e-cd85fae942ae" 17592186420350 "question-2642af15-1045-5d0f-97c1-3ce034155f08" 17592186420351 "question-89fae1b5-1405-51b4-b87d-75b6acbbdc2e" 17592186420352 "question-d2486be8-75b8-51f1-882e-08f8a79961f2" 17592186420353} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
